---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Kontak Partpedia"
  description="Hubungi Partpedia untuk pertanyaan seputar katalog, koreksi data, atau kerja sama bisnis."
>
  <article class="legal">

    <p class="eyebrow">Hubungi kami</p>
    <h1>Kontak</h1>
    <p class="meta">Kami membaca pesan terkait katalog, koreksi data, dan penawaran kerja sama.</p>

    <p>
      Untuk pertanyaan umum, usulan perbaikan data part, atau informasi kerja sama, Anda dapat menghubungi
      Partpedia melalui saluran berikut atau mengisi formulir di bawah.
    </p>

    <div class="card">
      <p style="margin:0 0 0.5rem"><strong>Telepon</strong></p>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--ink)">
        <a href="tel:+622648330329">(0264) 8330329</a>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <p style="margin:0 0 0.5rem"><strong>Email</strong></p>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--ink)">
        <a href="mailto:qca9299@gmail.com">qca9299@gmail.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-address">
      <p style="margin:0 0 0.5rem"><strong>Alamat</strong></p>
      <div class="address-row">
        <span class="pin" aria-hidden="true">📍</span>
        <p class="address-text">
          Babakan Sari, Kecamatan Kiaracondong<br />
          Bandung, Jawa Barat 40281<br />
          Indonesia
        </p>
      </div>
      <p style="margin:0.85rem 0 0;font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--muted)">
        Jam respons biasanya pada hari kerja. Mohon siapkan kode part atau tautan halaman terkait bila melapor koreksi data.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Formulir kerja sama / kontak profesional -->
    <section class="form-section" id="formulir" aria-labelledby="form-title">
      <h2 id="form-title">Formulir kontak &amp; kerja sama</h2>
      <p class="form-lead">
        Isi formulir ini untuk penawaran kerja sama, media partnership, koreksi data, atau pertanyaan bisnis.
        Pesan akan diteruskan ke email resmi Partpedia.
      </p>

      <form
        class="contact-form"
        action="https://formsubmit.co/qca9299@gmail.com"
        method="POST"
      >
        <!-- FormSubmit config -->
        <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Partpedia — Pesan dari formulir kontak" />
        <input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table" />
        <input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="true" />
        <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="https://partpedia.vercel.app/contact/?sent=1" />
        <input type="text" name="_honey" class="hp" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" />

        <div class="grid">
          <label class="field">
            <span>Nama lengkap <abbr title="wajib">*</abbr></span>
            <input type="text" name="nama" required maxlength="120" placeholder="Nama Anda atau perusahaan" autocomplete="name" />
          </label>
          <label class="field">
            <span>Email <abbr title="wajib">*</abbr></span>
            <input type="email" name="email" required maxlength="160" placeholder="nama@perusahaan.com" autocomplete="email" />
          </label>
        </div>

        <div class="grid">
          <label class="field">
            <span>Telepon / WhatsApp</span>
            <input type="tel" name="telepon" maxlength="40" placeholder="+62 …" autocomplete="tel" />
          </label>
          <label class="field">
            <span>Perusahaan / organisasi</span>
            <input type="text" name="perusahaan" maxlength="120" placeholder="Opsional" autocomplete="organization" />
          </label>
        </div>

        <label class="field">
          <span>Jenis pesan <abbr title="wajib">*</abbr></span>
          <select name="jenis" required>
            <option value="" disabled selected>Pilih jenis pesan</option>
            <option value="Kerja sama bisnis">Kerja sama bisnis</option>
            <option value="Media / konten partnership">Media / konten partnership</option>
            <option value="Koreksi data katalog">Koreksi data katalog</option>
            <option value="Pertanyaan umum">Pertanyaan umum</option>
            <option value="Lainnya">Lainnya</option>
          </select>
        </label>

        <label class="field">
          <span>Subjek <abbr title="wajib">*</abbr></span>
          <input type="text" name="subjek" required maxlength="160" placeholder="Ringkas isi pesan Anda" />
        </label>

        <label class="field">
          <span>Pesan <abbr title="wajib">*</abbr></span>
          <textarea name="pesan" required rows="6" maxlength="5000" placeholder="Jelaskan penawaran, kebutuhan, atau detail koreksi data…"></textarea>
        </label>

        <p class="form-note">
          Dengan mengirim formulir ini, Anda menyetujui bahwa data yang diisi digunakan untuk membalas pesan Anda
          sesuai <a href="/privacy/">Kebijakan privasi</a>.
        </p>

        <div class="form-actions">
          <button type="submit" class="btn-send">Kirim pesan</button>
        </div>
      </form>

      <p class="sent-banner" id="sent-banner" hidden role="status">
        Terima kasih — pesan Anda telah dikirim. Kami akan meninjau dan membalas melalui email bila diperlukan.
      </p>
    </section>

    <h2>Hal yang bisa kami bantu</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Koreksi spek, size, atau nama part di katalog</li>
      <li>Pertanyaan cara memakai pencarian dan filter kategori</li>
      <li>Informasi kerja sama konten atau penempatan yang relevan dengan MRO</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Hal yang di luar cakupan</h2>
    <p>
      Kami tidak dapat menjamin ketersediaan stok, harga final, atau garansi produk dari pihak ketiga.
      Untuk pembelian, ikuti proses di toko atau distributor yang Anda pilih.
    </p>

    <div class="foot-links">
      <a href="/about/">Tentang</a>
      <a href="/privacy/">Kebijakan privasi</a>
      <a href="/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a>
      <a href="/">← Katalog</a>
    </div>

  </article>

  <script is:inline>
    (function () {
      try {
        if (new URLSearchParams(location.search).get("sent") === "1") {
          const b = document.getElementById("sent-banner");
          if (b) {
            b.hidden = false;
            b.scrollIntoView({ behavior: "smooth", block: "center" });
          }
        }
      } catch (_) {}
    })();
  </script>

  <style>
  .legal {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 0 3.5rem;
  }
  .legal .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--teal);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }
  .legal h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.35rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .legal h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 0.65rem;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .legal p, .legal li {
    color: #c5d0dc;
    line-height: 1.75;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
  }
  .legal p { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .legal ul { margin: 0 0 1.15rem; padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  .legal li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .legal a { color: var(--amber); }
  .legal .meta {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }
  .legal .card {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem;
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
  }
  .legal .card strong { color: var(--ink); }
  .address-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .address-row .pin {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .address-text {
    margin: 0 !important;
    color: var(--ink) !important;
    font-size: 1.05rem !important;
    line-height: 1.55 !important;
  }
  .legal .foot-links {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem; padding-top: 1.25rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  /* Form */
  .form-section {
    margin: 2.25rem 0 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.35rem 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 18px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(120% 80% at 0% 0%, rgba(45,212,191,0.07), transparent 55%),
      var(--bg-card);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.14);
  }
  .form-section h2 { margin-top: 0; }
  .form-lead {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem !important;
    color: var(--muted) !important;
    font-size: 0.95rem !important;
  }
  .contact-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.85rem; }
  .contact-form .grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 560px) {
    .contact-form .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
  .field {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }
  .field span {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .field span abbr {
    color: var(--amber);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .field input,
  .field select,
  .field textarea {
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.22);
    color: var(--ink);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 0.7rem 0.85rem;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    font-family: inherit;
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }
  .field textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 140px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .field input:focus,
  .field select:focus,
  .field textarea:focus {
    border-color: rgba(45,212,191,0.55);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(45,212,191,0.12);
  }
  .field input::placeholder,
  .field textarea::placeholder { color: var(--muted); opacity: 0.85; }
  .field select {
    appearance: none;
    background-image: linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 50%, var(--muted) 50%),
      linear-gradient(135deg, var(--muted) 50%, transparent 50%);
    background-position: calc(100% - 18px) 55%, calc(100% - 12px) 55%;
    background-size: 6px 6px, 6px 6px;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
  }
  .hp {
    position: absolute !important;
    left: -9999px !important;
    opacity: 0 !important;
    height: 0 !important;
    width: 0 !important;
    pointer-events: none !important;
  }
  .form-note {
    margin: 0.15rem 0 0 !important;
    font-size: 0.82rem !important;
    color: var(--muted) !important;
    line-height: 1.5 !important;
  }
  .form-actions { margin-top: 0.35rem; }
  .btn-send {
    appearance: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 1.4rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2dd4bf, #14b8a6);
    color: #041016;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(45,212,191,0.25);
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }
  .btn-send:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 32px rgba(45,212,191,0.35);
  }
  .sent-banner {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(45,212,191,0.4);
    background: rgba(45,212,191,0.12);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  </style>
</Layout>
